t-0.1.4:action:4:2:2","op":"board.focus","focus":{"targets":["trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4:node:section-04-moment-02-item-02","trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"],"intent":"通过寻找波峰与零点理解正弦到余弦的平移关系"}},{"action_id":"trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4:action:4:2:3","op":"teacher.point","target":{"node_id":"trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"}}],"after_speech":[]}}]}}
{"dsl":"octos.lesson","version":"0.1","profile":"canonical","event":"lesson.close","lesson_id":"trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4","sequence":5,"result":{"summary":"本课程从单位圆动点在 x 轴上的投影出发，观察了余弦值随着旋转角度从 1 到 0 再到 -1 的动态变化，并展开得到余弦曲线 y = cos θ。进一步与正弦曲线对比，验证了两波形完全一致且存在 π/2 相位差的关系，从而直观推导出诱导公式 cos θ = sin(θ + π/2)。","summary_node_refs":[],"suggested_focus":["trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4:group:section-01-moment-01-item-01","trig-cosine-and-phase-shift-0.1.4:node:section-03-moment-02-item-01"]}}
